# export_alias_offers_item - an `export` entry takes `as`: `export M::{ printf as print };` binds `print` in the exporting module and offers it to its importers, to a brace import, a qualified path through the facade and a glob of a module re-exporting the facade, all naming `printf`; `export M as F;` offers the module under `F`.
